    {
      "id": "5cfe8383-626f-447e-8c74-3d803f8caef3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "Examples below refer to variables \"regioneconomy\" (Regional Economic Classification) and \"gnipc\" (Gross Regional Product of Chinese Provinces) and to the regional classification \"region4\". Change variable names according to your hypothesis. Edit labels, colors etc. to your individual preferences.",
      "metadata": {}
